        "hist_restoration_p1": "After the emergency freezing, the Historical and Geographical Institute of Rio Grande do Sul (IHGRGS) signed an agreement with Banrisul to fund the restoration operation. Specialized technicians performed freeze-drying, sanitization and disinfection of documents, recovering approximately 650 archive boxes with historical documents from the 19th and 20th centuries.",
